<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Budget Basket | Affordable Groceries & Toiletries</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #333;
    }
    header {
      background: #2e7d32;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    section {
      padding: 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    h2 {
      color: #2e7d32;
    }
    .products {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .product {
      background: #fafafa;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }
    .cta {
      background: #2e7d32;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 14px;
      background: #e0e0e0;
    }
    a.button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: #2e7d32;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Budget Basket</h1>
  <p>Affordable Groceries & Household Essentials</p>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>
      We are a local Vaal Triangle buy & sell business providing affordable groceries
      and household essentials to our community. Perfect for families, students,
      and anyone looking to save money.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Popular Products</h2>
    <div class="products">
      <div class="product">Rice (2kg)</div>
      <div class="product">Sugar (2kg)</div>
      <div class="product">Maize Meal (2kg)</div>
      <div class="product">Cooking Oil (500ml)</div>
      <div class="product">Washing Powder</div>
      <div class="product">Soap & Toiletries</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Send us a WhatsApp message with your order</li>
      <li>Confirm availability and price</li>
      <li>Collect or arrange delivery</li>
      <li>Cash or EFT on collection</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="cta">
    <h2>Order Now</h2>
    <p>Fast • Affordable • Local</p>
    <a href="#" class="button">WhatsApp Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>Budget Basket | Vanderbijlpark • Vereeniging • Sasolburg</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
